Tj T* (about living water, and then told her everything she had ever)Tj T* -.07812 Tw (done. She left her water jar at the well and went into the town)Tj T* 0 Tw (and said: "Come, see a man who told me everything I ever)Tj T* (did. Can this be the Christ?" Many Samaritans believed)Tj T* (because of her testimony \(John 4:39\). She was the first)Tj T* -.074227 Tw (evangelist in John's Gospel, and the first person in that Gospel)Tj T* 0 Tw (to call Jesus the Christ. A woman with a broken past became)Tj T* (the conduit for a whole town to meet its Saviour.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
