r every leader on this page,)Tj T* 0 Tw (and every leader on this page falls short of Him \(Hebrews)Tj T* (12:2\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 247.0213 cm .290196 .188235 0 rg 1.15 w BT 12.2 TL/F4+0 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 8 15.3 Tm (Application: Fix your eyes on Jesus)Tj <03>Tj (lead by serving, and let)Tj T* (His humility shape your every step.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
