Their prayer did not earn the answer, but it was the context in)Tj T* 0 Tw (which God acted. Earlier, when they were threatened by the)Tj T* (authorities, they had gathered and prayed, and the place)Tj T* (where they were meeting was shaken, and they were all filled)Tj T* (with the Holy Spirit and continued to speak the word of God)Tj T* (with boldness \(Acts 4:31\). Corporate prayer is not optional; it)Tj T* (is the lifeblood of the church.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 247.0213 cm .290196 .188235 0 rg 1.15 w BT 12.2 TL/F4+0 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 8 15.3 Tm (Application: Join with other believers in prayer this week, and)Tj T* (keep praying even when the answer seems impossible.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
