r is not only for the young or the)Tj T* (prominent. It is for the faithful, the persistent, the patient.)Tj T* (She prayed for years in a temple she may have wondered)Tj T* -.137301 Tw (would ever see the promised King, and then one day, there He)Tj T* 0 Tw (was \(Luke 2:38\).)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 273.2213 cm .290196 .188235 0 rg 1.15 w BT 12.2 TL/F4+0 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 8 15.3 Tm (Application: Stay faithful in prayer even when the answer)Tj T* (seems delayed, trusting that God rewards persistent devotion.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
