:44-48\). Cornelius shows)Tj T* (us that God hears the prayers of those who seek Him)Tj <02>Tj (even)Tj T* (those who do not yet know Jesus. His prayers did not save)Tj T* (him; the gospel did. But God in His mercy arranged the whole)Tj T* (encounter around Cornelius's prayers, and He used them to)Tj T* (open the door of the gospel to the entire Gentile world.)Tj T* (Prayer, in Cornelius's life, was the first step of a door that)Tj T* (God opened for all nations.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 233.9213 cm .290196 .188235 0 rg 1.15 w BT 12.2 TL/F4+0 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 8 15.3 Tm (Application: Never stop praying for those who do not yet know)Tj T* (Christ)Tj <03>Tj (their prayers matter to God even before they believe.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
