 Will he delay long over)Tj T* (them? I tell you, he will give justice to them speedily \(Luke)Tj T* (18:6-8\). The point is not that God is like an unjust judge but)Tj T* (that He is utterly unlike him. If even an unjust judge answers)Tj T* (persistent prayer, how much more will a good Father answer)Tj T* (the cries of His children? The widow is not a picture of)Tj T* (someone who has earned an answer but of someone who)Tj T* (refuses to give up. She shows us that persistent, honest,)Tj T* (repeated prayer is not a lack of faith)Tj <02>Tj (it is faith in action.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 208.6213 cm .290196 .188235 0 rg 1.15 w BT 12.2 TL/F4+0 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 8 27.5 Tm (Application: Do not lose heart in prayer)Tj <03>Tj (the persistent widow)Tj T* (is your model, and the Father you pray to is nothing like the)Tj T* (judge.)Tj T* ET Q Q Q
